+	/*
+	 * BC-250: release a held GFX clock/voltage override before *any*
+	 * display work starts -- before streams are disabled, before the link
+	 * is torn down, before training.
+	 *
+	 * Gated on an actual modeset. This runs on every atomic commit,
+	 * including every page flip, and calling it unconditionally re-arms
+	 * the restore timer on each frame so it never fires -- which locks the
+	 * governor out of the GPU for as long as anything is on screen. That
+	 * was a real regression, not a hypothetical.
+	 *
+	 * Inert on any non-Cyan-Skillfish GPU -- see cs_od_force_suspend().
+	 */
